<title>USA: Atwater to be treasurer at Banc One Corp.</title>
<headline>Atwater to be treasurer at Banc One Corp.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ohio 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banc One Corp said Tuesday that Peter Atwater will be named treasurer upon completion of the $6.7 billion merger with First USA Inc, which Banc One expects to close in the second quarter.</p>
<p>The company said he  will have responsibility for liability management, liquidity, and capital management.</p>
<p>Atwater has been serving as executive vice president and treasurer of First USA for the past year, where he was responsible for on- and off-balance funding, capital management, liquidity, and hedging.</p>
<p>Banc One officials were unavailable for further comment.</p>
</text>
